      ],
      "text": "Guidance for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        277.722412109375,
        21.884788513183594,
        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.1881103515625,
        513.4489135742188,
        96.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "of opportunistic infections (including TB), reduce the viral load, restore and preserve",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        99.18463134765625,
        513.4144897460938,
        112.5361328125
      ],
      "text": "immune function, and restore and preserve normal growth and development. ART",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        115.18115234375,
        385.1434326171875,
        128.53265380859375
      ],
      "text": "improves TB treatment outcomes for children living with HIV.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        139.61868286132812,
        513.3570556640625,
        153.0391845703125
      ],
      "text": "(13) WHO  recommends that ART be provided to all people with a confirmed HIV diagnosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        155.6842041015625,
        513.41455078125,
        169.03570556640625
      ],
      "text": "and a CD4 count of 500 cells/mm³ or less, giving priority to those with severe/advanced",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        171.68072509765625,
        513.4375610351562,
        185.0322265625
      ],
      "text": "HIV disease or a CD4 count of 350 cells/mm³ or less. WHO also recommends that ART",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        187.67724609375,
        513.4489135742188,
        201.02874755859375
      ],
      "text": "be initiated in people with active TB and HBV co-infection with severe liver disease, all",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        203.67376708984375,
        513.4835205078125,
        217.0252685546875
      ],
      "text": "pregnant and breastfeeding women with HIV, all children younger than 5 years living",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        219.6702880859375,
        513.4030151367188,
        233.02178955078125
      ],
      "text": "with HIV and all individuals with HIV in serodiscordant relationships, regardless of CD4",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        235.66680908203125,
        135.51290893554688,
        249.018310546875
      ],
      "text": "cell count.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        260.17327880859375,
        513.4259643554688,
        273.5247802734375
      ],
      "text": "TB treatment should be started first, followed by ART as soon as possible thereafter (and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        276.1697998046875,
        510.26348876953125,
        289.52130126953125
      ],
      "text": "within 8 weeks of the start of TB treatment). For those with a CD4 count below 50 cells/",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        292.0973205566406,
        513.3569946289062,
        305.517822265625
      ],
      "text": "(13) mm³, ART should be provided within 2 weeks of the start of TB treatment . Table 7",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        308.162841796875,
        418.2404479980469,
        321.51434326171875
      ],
      "text": "summarizes the recommendations on when to start ART in children.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        332.6693420410156,
        513.4949951171875,
        346.0208435058594
      ],
      "text": "For first-line ART, use of simplified and less toxic regimens – as fixed-dose combinations",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        348.66583251953125,
        513.4833984375,
        362.017333984375
      ],
      "text": "whenever possible – is recommended as the most effective and convenient approach.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        364.6623229980469,
        513.4260864257812,
        378.0138244628906
      ],
      "text": "Regimens comprising a non-thymidine nucleoside reverse-transcriptase inhibitor (NRTI)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        380.6588134765625,
        513.4374389648438,
        394.01031494140625
      ],
      "text": "backbone (tenofovir disoproxil fumarate (TDF) or abacavir (ABC) + lamivudine (3TC))",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        396.6553039550781,
        513.4374389648438,
        410.0068054199219
      ],
      "text": "and one non-nucleoside reverse-transcriptase inhibitor (NNRTI) efavirenz (EFV) are",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        412.65179443359375,
        513.3914184570312,
        426.0032958984375
      ],
      "text": "maintained as the preferred choices in adolescents and children older than 3 years. For",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        428.6482849121094,
        513.4144897460938,
        441.9997863769531
      ],
      "text": "children younger than 3 years, a protease inhibitor (PI)-based regimen is the preferred",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        444.5757751464844,
        381.3713684082031,
        457.99627685546875
      ],
      "text": "(13) approach in combination with ABC or zidovudine (AZT)  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.45938110351562,
        486.0604248046875,
        510.2234191894531,
        500.2804260253906
      ],
      "text": "Summary of recommendations on when to start ART in children  (13)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        486.3484191894531,
        127.59138488769531,
        500.2804260253906
      ],
      "text": "Table 7.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.03939819335938,
        508.38067626953125,
        335.5293273925781,
        522.3206787109375
      ],
      "text": "Age When to start",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.03939819335938,
        523.7807006835938,
        467.4493103027344,
        537.0906982421875
      ],
      "text": "Infants (<1 year) Treat all individuals regardless of CD4 count",
      "font": "ArialMT",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.03939819335938,
        539.0607299804688,
        356.849365234375,
        552.3707275390625
      ],
      "text": "1 year to <5 years Treat all individuals",
      "font": "ArialMT",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        271.639404296875,
        557.0607299804688,
        509.0291748046875,
        570.3707275390625
      ],
      "text": "(children ≤2 years or with WHO stage 3 or 4 or CD4",
      "font": "ArialMT",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        271.639404296875,
        569.0607299804688,
        464.68927001953125,
        582.3707275390625
      ],
      "text": "count ≤750 cells/mm³ or <25% as a priority)",
      "font": "ArialMT",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.03939819335938,
        584.3406982421875,
        508.9992370605469,
        597.6506958007812
      ],
      "text": "5 years and above WHO stage 3 or 4 or CD4 ≤500 cells/mm³ (CD4 ≤350",
      "font": "ArialMT",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        271.639404296875,
        596.3406982421875,
        372.1993103027344,
        609.6506958007812
      ],
      "text": "cells/mm³ as a priority)",
      "font": "ArialMT",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        617.9249877929688,
        513.4260864257812,
        631.2764892578125
      ],
      "text": "Selecting ARV regimens that are compatible with TB therapy is essential. Interactions",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        633.9215087890625,
        510.2172546386719,
        647.2730102539062
      ],
      "text": "between rifampicin and lopinavir/ritonavir (LPV/r) or nevirapine (NVP) mean that co-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        649.9180297851562,
        513.4375,
        663.26953125
      ],
      "text": "treatment in children under three years is challenging, but a recent large randomized",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        665.91455078125,
        513.3914184570312,
        679.2660522460938
      ],
      "text": "controlled trial of ART in children has generated preliminary evidence on the efficacy of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        681.9110717773438,
        513.4143676757812,
        695.2625732421875
      ],
      "text": "triple nucleoside therapy which, despite limited data in the context of TB co-treatment,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        697.9075317382812,
        513.4489135742188,
        711.259033203125
      ],
      "text": "offers a suitable option for children who require TB treatment while already receiving",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        713.8350830078125,
        152.87789916992188,
        727.2555541992188
      ],
      "text": "(13, 15) ART  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        738.4105224609375,
        513.4375,
        751.7620239257812
      ],
      "text": "Table 8 below gives a summary of recommended ART regimens for children in need of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        754.3380737304688,
        174.29090881347656,
        767.758544921875
      ],
      "text": "(13) TB treatment  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "61",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}